      "writtenOn": "2014-06-22T16:55:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The update notification will always be emitted. The disabled (called via self._disable_project), will only be emitted when/if the projects enabled flag is toggled to False. \n\nThis simply prevents extra \u0027disabled\u0027 notifications from going out if the project is already disabled and the update contains \u0027enabled: False\u0027, since there was no change in the enabled flag state.",
      "parentUuid": "1ae5cdf2_f605397a",
